<title>GREECE: IONIAN BANK PRES MEETS WITH U.S. EXEC'S, BUSINESSMEN.</title>
<headline>IONIAN BANK PRES MEETS WITH U.S. EXEC'S, BUSINESSMEN.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank president Haris Stamatopoulos who joined national economy minister Yannos Papandoniou's official visit to the U.S. met with distinguished bankers and businessmen, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>Stamatopoulos met with Alex Spanos, president of the Greek-American Business Council, U.S. senator Olympia Snowe and Eugene Rosidis, president of the Hellenic-American Institute and Lehman Brothers vice-president Sherman Lewis, it said. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
